# Renderer runtime assets, written by `pnpm --filter @montaj/web assets:render`
# (scripts/copy-render-assets.mjs). They are copies of files that already live in
# `canvaskit-wasm`, `@montaj/render-core/fixtures` and (A14)
# `@montaj/caption-styles/previews`, so committing them would only duplicate the
# bytes and let the two drift.
public/canvaskit/
public/fonts/
public/style-previews/

# `e2e/export.spec.ts` generates this with ffmpeg on first run (`ensureFixtureVideo`);
# committing a binary video fixture would only duplicate bytes a one-line script makes.
public/e2e-fixtures/
